id: pm-csv-uaq1
title: Full git history retains personal identity and redacted host-path blobs
description: "A 195-commit all-ref scan found 283 historical blob/path matches across six tracker artifacts and 106 commits authored with a personal email address. No high-confidence secret token or private-key path hits were found. The prior head-only redaction item pm-csv-tl5j explicitly left old blobs intact, so current files may be clean while the public immutable history still violates the requested no-private-or-personal-history gate. Repair requires an authorized coordinated history rewrite and force-update; do not publish a new release until the maintainer approves the identity mapping and remote migration plan."
